==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use piercing units such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] to assist in clearing the peons at the beginning. [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]] outranges Fallen Bear and is able to pierce his Shield relatively easily. Once the Shield is down, time Awakened Bahamut Cat to hit Fallen Bear; depending on the level of your seal, it's usually enough to instantly kill him. Alternatively, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Any]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragon]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Variant]] outranges all of the supports and can strike Fallen Bear from a distance, though, Li'l King Dragon Cat's Surge Immunity Talent makes him optimal for the job if you own him.

